  "content_en": "Chapter One: First Marriage Two ladies from the palace hold chess pieces with different expressions. One frowns and thinks deeply about the next move, while the other smiles and is confident. \"I'm going to lose.\" The sixth lady covered her nose with an inkstone and smiled softly, without any trace of illness on her face. The fifth lady, Su Qi, looked at her and couldn't find a way out, so she dropped the chess pieces, \"No more playing, let's try again!\" \"Really gave up?\" Su Qi looked at the chess game and wanted to give up, but she was not willing to give up, but she couldn't find a way to solve it. \"Sister Luo Xue? Yan Shu, look over there.\" She stretched out her slender hand and pointed in the direction of Luo Xue. Yan Shu turned around and saw Luo Xue looking at him not far away, beckoning, \"Luo Xue, come here.\" It's always bad to refuse someone's invitation, and besides, Luo Xue still liked Yan Shu very much. He walked to the stone table and glanced at the chess game. \"Are you playing chess?\" Yan Shu put down the chess pieces in his hand. \"Yes, I was dragged here by force.\" \"What! You stay bored in the house every day, it would be strange if you don't get sick from boredom!\" Su Qi tried to defend himself. Luo Xue wanted to laugh, but after all, this was the first time she had contact with Su Qi. She was afraid that laughing would be bad, so she suppressed it, \"Sister, staying in the house all the time is really not good for your health.\" \"Sister Luo Xue speaks respectfully. Yan Shu always mentions it in front of me. It's your turn.\" With a nice smile, Luo Xue moved her eyes to the chessboard, \"Whose turn is it?\" Yanshu pointed at Su Qi opposite, \"It's her turn.\" Luo Xue picked up the white piece in front of Su Qi and put it on the chessboard. My sister will take the step.\" Yanshu lowered his head, looked at the chess game, frowned, and said for a long time, \"I'm afraid I lost.\" Hearing this, Suqi also lowered his head, \"What a good chess, I finally asked Yanshu to admit defeat! Luo Xue, you know, since Yanshu fell off the horse. , It's like she's a different person, her chess skills have improved a lot, and I haven't even beaten her. Since Yanshu has given up, we won't play, Luo Xue, sit down.\" Luo Xue sat down and asked, \"Falled?\" Yanshu smiled sweetly and shook his head. Su Qi sighed, \"After that horse fall, Yan Shu can't remember the past. In the final analysis, it was all Yelu Zhuling's fault!\" \"Okay, let's let the past happen to Su Qi. Didn't you often say that we can't come back without the second wife? Just forget about the past things.\" Yan Shu blocked Su Qi with words, worried that she would get into trouble. Su Qi ignored Yan Shu's meaning and continued gloating: \"After the last breakfast, I heard from my servants that our second lady was punished by the master.\" \"Punished? Why?\" Luo Xue was worried that the second lady Zhu Ling's punishment had something to do with her. Thinking about that breakfast, her departure was indeed inseparable from her. Su Qi took the chess pieces and placed them randomly on the chessboard. \"It's been a year. I haven't learned well. It's weird if I don't get punished.\" \"Su Qi, what did you say?\" A savage voice in the distance rushed to their ears, which really startled the three of them. Without looking, they could guess that it was the second lady chasing Ling. Su Qi looked at Zhu Ling walking toward her aggressively, and smiled contemptuously, \"Just say what you need to say. Talking and chatting, is the second lady still needed?\" \"You!\" Second lady Zhu Ling was choked and couldn't find anything to say, so she had to raise her hand towards Su Qi. Su Qi stood up and caught Zhu Ling's raised hand with one hand, \"Second Madam, do you still think you are the little princess of the foreign vassal? This is the palace, and I said that we are equals!\" Being equal was what the prince told Luo Xue. At that time, the prince just wanted to show Luo Xue's status, but he didn't know that it turned out to be a topic for Su Qi to ridicule Zhu Ling. Su Qi's words brought back the unhealed wounds in Zhu Ling's heart. She looked at Luo Xue and said bitterly, \"You are worthy of being treated as equals?\" The look in her eyes made Luo Xue not sure how to respond. \"Why don't you deserve it? I said this myself.\" Su Qi mocked Zhu Ling. \"You...\" Su Qi sat down and continued to play with the chess pieces, \"How does it feel for the second lady to be punished?\" Luo Xue was a little embarrassed when she was caught in the middle. The gentle spring breeze raised her green hair. She smoothed it with her hands and turned her head to the side. Only then did she see the fourth lady Lian Hua behind Zhu Ling and the princess Ting Ning from far to near. \"Ahem!\" Princess Ting Ning interrupted their argument, \"Can't the sisters be quiet? Zhu Ling, weren't you fine just now? What's wrong now?\" Zhu Ling pretended to be aggrieved, \"Some people were gossiping behind their backs, and I overheard them by chance.\" \"Who is so bold! I hate people who gossip about people the most!\" Princess Ting Ning knew in her heart what Zhu Ling was talking about.Since they married into the prince's palace, they always had a quarrel with each other. \"Who else could it be? If I knew about it, I'd be afraid that I wouldn't be able to eat anything and would have to carry it around, right?\" Zhu Ling put on a proud look. \"If I really find out, I don't know who to punish!\" Su Qi said, imitating Zhu Ling. \"You...\" Ting Ning pulled Zhu Ling, \"Su Qi, do you want me to punish you?\" Ting Ning's words suppressed Su Qi's momentum, and there was no sound in the garden for a moment. \"There are still some people, although I say they are equal, but don't dream!\" Zhu Ling stared at Luo Xue who had not spoken for a long time and said angrily. \"That's enough!\" Princess Ting Ning yelled loudly, \"Sister Luo Xue didn't offend you, did you? Do you want me to punish you?\" \"You all like her, don't you? I punished me because of her, and my sister wants to punish me now, or because of her! What is good about her? And Keqin, what is good about her? I will never forget her!\" Zhu Ling pointed at Luo Xue, who had already regarded Luo Xue as an enemy in her heart. \"That's enough, Zhu Ling! How long are you going to keep making trouble? Have I indulged you too much?\" \"Huh!\" Zhu Ling knew that he was being ignored by others when he stayed here. He rolled up his sleeves, said something to Lian Hua behind him, and walked away without looking back. Luo Xue stared intently at their leaving figures, completely unaware that she had bitten her lips to draw blood. Princess Ting Ning calmly walked to Luo Xue, \"Don't be surprised, sister, Zhu Ling has always been like this. There is no way, she loves her father too much.\" \"Hate because of love?\" Su Qi said, full of ridicule. Yanshu hurriedly reached out and pinched her arm, then blocked Su Qi's mouth. \"I wonder if the princess sister is just walking around or has something to do?\" \"I almost forgot about the serious matter. This morning, the prince sent someone to deliver some pieces of fabric. You all happened to be here, so I don't have to go and invite them one by one. When you have time, you can come to my place to pick.\" Ting Ning held Luo Xue's hand and looked at her, \"Sister specially reserved a few pieces for my sister. , thinking that it complements my sister's handsome and refined appearance.\" Luo Xuefu leaned down and said, \"Luo Xue thanked sister.\" After helping Luo Xue, Ting Ning said with a smile: \"We are all sisters, so don't be so rude. I just asked my sister to take care of me. I won't bother you.\" After that, she left them generously. Seeing Ting Ning walking away, Su Qi stuck out his tongue in disgust at her back, pretending to be her, and whispered: \"Sisters, I won't disturb you anymore.\" \"Su Qi!\" Yan Shu blocked Su Qi's mouth with his hand. \"Be careful because your mouth will kill you in the future!\" Pulling off Yan Shu's hand, Su Qi raised his orchid finger and sang in a playful voice: \"I have to be careful.\" \"Plop!\" Yan Shu couldn't help it anymore and started laughing. \"Sister Luo Xue, Zhu Ling is so virtuous. When Ke Qin was here before, she always made trouble for Ke Qin, but now Ke Qin is gone...\" \"Su Qi, the unpleasant things are over, why bring it up again? It's really disappointing.\" Ke Qin is a taboo topic in the palace. Yan Shu doesn't want Luo Xue to know too much about Ke Qin, nor does he want Su Qi to get into trouble because of his quick talk. Yan Shu knew clearly that the princess' accusation against Zhu Ling just now was not because of Luo Xue, but because she mentioned Ke Qin. Luo Xue knowingly did not mention Ke Qin. She smiled, \"Zhu Ling must also love the prince, right?\" Su Qi's face showed a disgusted expression, \"Well, her love was so intense, so intense that she married us all!\" \"What does this mean?\" Luo Xue was confused. Yanshu pulled up Luo Xue, looked up and down, and said, \"Let's not talk about this, Luo Xue. When I make new clothes someday, I have to ask my sister to take a look.\" \"Is my sister making fun of Luo Xue?\" Luo Xue lowered her head, hiding the slight blush on her face. \"No, no! Sister is just curious, how does a person with such a mark look like in new clothes.\" \"Oh, Yanshu, you are embarrassed to say all that Luo Xue said.\" Su Qi also stood up, and she pulled Luo Xue over, \"Sister Luo Xue, come to my place another day, and let's ask for advice on how to play chess.\" \"Sister Su Qi, you don't dare to ask for advice. Quan takes it as learning from each other, the two sisters. Sister, you should come to Xiaozhu more often when you have time.\" \"Then you should treat me well!\" Su Qi smiled and looked at Yanshu, \"Yanshu is in poor health, so we should visit her more!\" \"I'm not as useless as you said! Am I okay now?\" Yanshu took a deep breath and looked intoxicated. \"I don’t know who was pushing me for a long time and not wanting to come over! Su Qi joked. \"Luo Xue, look at her. She must have eaten something wrong today.\" \"Jian Yanshu used Luo Xue as an excuse, Su Qi took advantage of every opportunity and said angrily: \"Yanshu can be embarrassed sometimes! \"Okay, okay, Suqi, I'm afraid of you. I won't talk nonsense to you. Let's go to the princess's place to look at the fabrics.\" \"I'm afraid something is going to happen in the house again.\" Our princess has always been good at this kind of appearance. \"Su Qi picked a peach blossom from the tree, put it under his nose and smelled it, \"I really can't figure out why the princess has to protect and chase Ling out so many times. Yan Shu took the flower from her hand and gently touched Su Qi's nose with his hand, \"You think everyone is as heartless as you. Zhu Ling came here for marriage, so of course the princess must take more care of her!\" \"Su Qi crossbowed and snatched the peach blossom, \"It's as if you didn't come here to marry me! \"... Along the way, there was no topic that Su Qi couldn't talk about. It was really a pain for Yanshu, a sick beauty.",
